text The Made with Bulma badge is available in 6 different versions:
table Type Preview Description Download
  Default |  | White boxed | Download image
  Dark |  | Dark boxed | Download image
  Semi white |  | Transparent white and turquoise | Download image
  White |  | Transparent white | Download image
  Semiblack |  | Transparent black and turquoise | Download image
  Black |  | Transparent black | Download image
  All 6 | made-with-bulma-badges.zip | Download all 6 badges
h3 "Usage #"
text "Ideally the image is displayed at 128x24 pixels, and links back to the Bulma website:"
text Example
link "https://bulma.io" https://bulma.io
text HTML
text "<a href=\"https://bulma.io\"> <img src=\"https://bulma.io/assets/images/made-with-bulma.png\" alt=\"Made with Bulma\" width=\"128\" height=\"24\"> </a>"
button Copy danger
text "Since the original image dimensions are 512x96 pixels, you can also display it at 256x48 without losing any quality:"
text Example
link "https://bulma.io" https://bulma.io
text HTML
text "<a href=\"https://bulma.io\"> <img src=\"https://bulma.io/assets/images/made-with-bulma.png\" alt=\"Made with Bulma\" width=\"256\" height=\"48\"> </a>"
button Copy danger
